{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47202","headline":"初冬旅舍早怀 · 怀浦","name":"初冬旅舍早怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枕上角声微，离情未息机。\n梦回三楚寺，寒入五更衣。\n月没栖禽动，霜晴冻叶飞。\n自慙行役早，深与道相违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"怀浦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}